%% MSC 2 — PDU Session Establishment on the URLLC slice with local UPF selection and PCF QoS rules (TS 23.502 §4.3.2.2.1)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UE as Crane CPE
    participant gNB
    participant AMF
    participant SMF
    participant PCF
    participant UPF as Local UPF (on-site)
    UE->>AMF: NAS UL NAS Transport [PDU Session Establishment Request]<br/>(PDU session ID, S-NSSAI SST2/SD000001, DNN control.port5g)
    AMF->>SMF: Nsmf_PDUSession_CreateSMContext (SUPI, S-NSSAI, DNN, PDU session ID)
    Note over AMF,SMF: AMF selects SMF via NRF filtered by S-NSSAI + DNN.
    SMF->>PCF: Npcf_SMPolicyControl_Create (SUPI, S-NSSAI, DNN)
    PCF-->>SMF: PCC rules: flow S1_control → 5QI 82, ARP {PL 1, MAY_PREEMPT, NOT_PREEMPTABLE}, GFBR/MFBR 0.2/0.5 Mbit/s
    Note over SMF,UPF: SMF selects the on-site UPF (DNAI = terminal MEC; latency proof: remote UPF fails the 10 ms PDB).
    SMF->>UPF: PFCP Session Establishment Request (PDR/FAR/QER: QFI=82 mapping, GBR enforcement, N3 tunnel)
    UPF-->>SMF: PFCP Session Establishment Response (UPF F-TEID)
    SMF->>AMF: Namf_Communication_N1N2MessageTransfer<br/>(N2 SM info: QoS Flow Setup List [QFI, 5QI, ARP, GBR]; N1: PDU Session Establishment Accept)
    AMF->>gNB: NGAP PDU Session Resource Setup Request (N2 SM info, NAS PDU)
    gNB->>UE: RRC Reconfiguration (DRB for QFI 82, SDAP mapping, configured grant for URLLC)
    UE-->>gNB: RRC Reconfiguration Complete
    gNB-->>AMF: NGAP PDU Session Resource Setup Response (gNB N3 F-TEID)
    AMF->>SMF: Nsmf_PDUSession_UpdateSMContext (N2 info)
    SMF->>UPF: PFCP Session Modification (DL FAR → gNB F-TEID)
    UPF-->>SMF: PFCP Session Modification Response
    Note over UE,UPF: User plane active: UE ⇄ gNB ⇄ UPF ⇄ MEC crane-control app. Capture NGAP + PFCP for figure 10.
